    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d564-a1">

                <pb facs="0570" n="472" xml:id="pg472"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of the Rochambeau
                            Committee to Mr. Porter</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Vendôme</hi></placeName>,<lb/><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-03-27"><hi rendition="#italic">March 27,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Rochambeau and commercial committees, presided over by the mayor of Vendôme,
                    on the occasion of the laying of the capstone of the Rochambeau monument, beg
                    your excellency to accept the expression of their respectful consideration, and
                    to have the goodness to transmit to President McKinley the brotherly greeting
                    which they address to the American people.</p>
                <p>The Star Spangled Banner (pavilion étoilé) of the United States floats on the
                    scaffolding of the monument united to the flag of France.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rojan</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Secretary of the Committee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
